    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="2.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:ICn">I Cn</ref> 2.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Þonne is swiðe rihtlic, þæt Godes ciricgrið binnon wagum ⁊ Cristenes ciningces handgrið stande æfre unwemme; ⁊ se ðe aðor fulbrece þolige landes ⁊ lifes, butan [him] se ciningc gearian wille.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Therefore it is very right and proper that the protection given by the church of God within its walls, and the protection granted by a Christian king in person should always remain inviolate; and he who violates either of them shall lose both land and life, unless the king is willing to pardon him.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Þonne is swiðe rihtlic, þæt Godes ciricgrið binnon wagum ⁊ Cristenes ciningces handgrið stande æfre unwemme; ⁊ se ðe aðor fulbrece, þolige landes ⁊ lifes, butan se ciningc gearian wylle.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
